WPIPilot - Custom GCS Software for Autonomous Boats

Files:

SITL.zip - Contains the files needed to run the SITL simulation.
guiTest.py - This is code meant for the GUI. Utilizes PyQt6. Very simple window is created
listenTest.py - Receives MavLink data. Currently set to listen from the simulation.
telemetryDemo.py - Made to show to the prof. that we can actually get data from the simulation.
